  "ingredients": [
    "1/2 cup almond flour",
    "2 tablespoon allulose",
    "1/2 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "2 tablespoon butter (melted)",
    "salt (pinch)",
    "8 ounce cream cheese (softened)",
    "1/4 cup allulose",
    "1/4 cup sour cream",
    "2 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "1 large egg (room temperature)",
    "1 tablespoon allulose",
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 tablespoon butter (softened)",
    "3 tablespoon allulose (powdered)",
    "1/2 teaspoon vanilla extract",
    "2 teaspoon heavy cream"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Gather and prep all ingredients. Pre-heat oven to 325F.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/mini-keto-cinnamon-roll-cheesecakes/#wprm-recipe-54853-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Mini-Cinnamon-Roll-Cheesecakes-1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Start by making the crust. Add almond flour, allulose, cinnamon, melted butter, and a pinch of salt to a bowl.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/mini-keto-cinnamon-roll-cheesecakes/#wprm-recipe-54853-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Mini-Cinnamon-Roll-Cheesecakes-2.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix the ingredients together until the mixture clumps together.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/mini-keto-cinnamon-roll-cheesecakes/#wprm-recipe-54853-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Mini-Cinnamon-Roll-Cheesecakes-3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Press the crust mixture into a lined cupcake tray. Bake for 7-8 minutes and then remove from the oven to cool. Turn the oven temperature down to 300F.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/mini-keto-cinnamon-roll-cheesecakes/#wprm-recipe-54853-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Mini-Cinnamon-Roll-Cheesecakes-4.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Create the filling while the crusts are cooling. Whip the cream cheese and allulose together.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/mini-keto-cinnamon-roll-cheesecakes/#wprm-recipe-54853-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Mini-Cinnamon-Roll-Cheesecakes-5.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add in the sour cream, vanilla, and egg and mix thoroughly to combine. Try to get rid of any lumps. Spoon the mixture over the crusts to distribute evenly.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/mini-keto-cinnamon-roll-cheesecakes/#wprm-recipe-54853-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Mini-Cinnamon-Roll-Cheesecakes-6.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "In a separate bowl, mix the allulose and cinnamon together to create the cinnamon \"sugar\" topping.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/mini-keto-cinnamon-roll-cheesecakes/#wprm-recipe-54853-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Mini-Cinnamon-Roll-Cheesecakes-7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sprinkle the topping over the cheesecakes, then bake for 16-17 minutes or until set with a bit of jiggle. Allow to cool for a few minutes, then place in the refrigerator for 2-4 hours to cool completely.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/mini-keto-cinnamon-roll-cheesecakes/#wprm-recipe-54853-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Mini-Cinnamon-Roll-Cheesecakes-8.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Create the icing before ready to serve. Powder the allulose by blending in a coffee/spice grinder or a food processor. Mix the allulose with the butter until fully combined, then add in the vanilla and heavy cream as needed to get the consistency you want. Transfer icing to a ziplock bag and cut a small hole into the corner, then drizzle icing over cheesecakes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/mini-keto-cinnamon-roll-cheesecakes/#wprm-recipe-54853-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2023/08/Mini-Cinnamon-Roll-Cheesecakes-9.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ice the remaining cheesecakes and enjoy!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/mini-keto-cinnamon-roll-cheesecakes/#wprm-recipe-54853-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
